<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="main-hand-and-two-handed-weapons-for-frost-mage-dps-phase-4">Main-Hand and Two-Handed Weapons for Frost Mage DPS Phase 4</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50732/bloodsurge-kelthuzads-blade-of-agony">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_150.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bloodsurge, Kel'Thuzad's Blade of Agony</span></a> is the uncontested best in slot, with the other <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=36597/the-lich-king">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Lich King</span></a> weapon, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50731/archus-greatstaff-of-antonidas">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_108.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Archus, Greatstaff of Antonidas</span></a> as second. The other weapons are listed in terms of performance assuming you can optimally use the hit in the weapons that have it.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: Depending on one-handed or two-handed weapon you'll use a different enchant:<ul class="last">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Staff: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=62948/enchant-staff-greater-spellpower">
