<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="wands-for-frost-mage-dps-phase-4">Wands for Frost Mage DPS Phase 4</h4>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50684/corpse-impaling-spike">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_wand_35.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Corpse-Impaling Spike</span></a> is best, but only better than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50631/nightmare-ender">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_wand_34.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nightmare Ender</span></a> by about 40 dps. There's the hit wand from 10-man <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51852/wand-of-ruby-claret">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_wand_34.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wand of Ruby Claret</span></a> which can be a great upgrade assuming you're using the previous best in slot wand <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45294/petrified-ivy-sprig">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_wand_29.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Petrified Ivy Sprig</span></a>. Alternatively, if it's within your budget, you can buy the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50472/nightmare-ender">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_wand_34.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nightmare Ender</span></a> outside of raid since it's a bind on equip lower ilvl version of the second best wand - it's not amazing but an upgrade from phase 3 gear nonetheless.<div class="pad"></div>
